 and powerful movement abilities </strong></i>- Skillfully pivot your slide around corners, down slopes, kick or jump off walls, and alternate between rolling or side-stepping in intimate duels. These are easy to use but will take time to master.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/08bb5db83c0f9434220e0998caf523ce.poster.avif?t=1755529072\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/08bb5db83c0f9434220e0998caf523ce.webm?t=1755529072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/08bb5db83c0f9434220e0998caf523ce.mp4?t=1755529072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/6ceafc7545b23349606ab971b0656a1b.poster.avif?t=1755529072\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/6ceafc7545b23349606ab971b0656a1b.webm?t=1755529072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/6ceafc7545b23349606ab971b0656a1b.mp4?t=1755529072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/7fd02018a97755bcd38b212ed709fa02.poster.avif?t=1755529072\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333990/extras/7fd02018a97755bcd38b212ed709